{
  "id": "scarlet-violet-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Scarlet & Violet Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Scarlet & Violet prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 18–19 and 25–26 March 2023, and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program. Each box held four Scarlet & Violet booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Scarlet & Violet logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Quaquaval, Dondozo, Pawmot, Revavroom and both Professor's Research cards, Professor Sada's and Professor Turo's, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
